        div.classList : 9140ms
        div.classList.foo = 123 : 9086ms
        div.dataset : 9930ms
        div.dataset.foo = 123 : 49698ms
        div.attributes : 13489ms

        Chromium/V8 (with this patch):
        div.classList : 1435ms
